the reference of the XML language, shipped by the same package
.RB ( sermo\-backend\-gtk4 ).
.PP
.BR gtk3sermo (1),
.BR haplo\-dialog\-xml (5)
\(em the GTK\ 3 port and its own reference, shipped by the
.B sermo\-backend\-gtk3
package.
.PP
